# person.map — password-retention change (the ONLY stock mapping change needed)
#
# Stock FDS deliberately discards the source password (pass-through-auth model):
#     userPassword=generatePassword(null)
#
# To RETAIN credentials into OpenLDAP, edit the stock
# sdi_solution_dir/LDAPSync/person.map and change that single line to:
#
#     userPassword=migratePassword(work)
#
# migratePassword() is provided by customScript-additions.js (append it to the
# stock LDAPSync/customScript.js). It passes {scheme}-prefixed hashes through
# verbatim and hashes cleartext (IVD AES-decrypted) to {SSHA} before writing.
#
# Minimal alternative with NO custom function (cleartext stays cleartext at rest):
#     userPassword=work.userPassword
#
# Do NOT replace stock person.map wholesale — every other line (objectClass via
# userObjectClass(work)/target.userObjectClass, RDN, attributes) is correct as
# shipped, and adDn is set by the FDS engine, not mapped.
